Generic single-database configuration with async support for ContaFlow.

This Alembic environment is configured to work with SQLAlchemy 2.0 Async.

## Usage

### Create a new migration
```bash
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of changes"
```

### Apply migrations
```bash
alembic upgrade head
```

### Rollback last migration
```bash
alembic downgrade -1
```

### View current revision
```bash
alembic current
```

### View migration history
```bash
alembic history --verbose
```

## Important Notes

- Database URL is loaded from the DATABASE_URL environment variable
- Never hardcode credentials in alembic.ini
- Always review auto-generated migrations before applying
- Test migrations in development before applying to production
